      <div class="mt-12 sm:mt-16 pt-6 sm:pt-8" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(224,184,79,0.1);">
        <p class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-[#E4E0F7] italic text-base sm:text-lg font-light px-2">"May your steps be blessed, and may your presence illuminate our celebration forever."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
