        <span class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-[#E0B84F] text-xl sm:text-2xl">M &amp; P</span>
        <div class="h-px w-16 sm:w-48" style="background:linear-gradient(270deg,transparent,#E0B84F);"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center space-y-2 mb-8 sm:mb-10 px-2">
        <p class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-[#E4E0F7] text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold">Mukesh Ojha &amp; Puja</p>
        <p class="font-['Montserrat'] text-[#E0B84F] text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase">11th December 2026 · Dugda, Bokaro, Jharkhand</p>
        <p class="font-['Montserrat'] font-light text-[#D1C5B1] italic text-xs sm:text-sm max-w-md mx-auto">"With the blessings of our ancestors and divine grace, we invite you to honor our auspicious royal union."</p>
